      },
      "message": "ci(release): site_only dispatch builds and deploys only the site\n\nA boolean input `site_only` (default false) on the existing\nworkflow_dispatch of release.yml. With it, only `site` and `pages` run,\nfrom the dispatched ref; linux, macos, windows and wasm are skipped (aur,\nsnap and flatpak follow linux). `publish` stays tag-only. `pages` deploys\non that path only from a `site/*` branch. No trigger is added.\n\nPinned by xtask/tests/release_site_tests.rs\n(site_only_dispatch_runs_only_site_and_pages).\n\nRefs #3276\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
