      "message": "ci(release): publish skips on site_only; decision file named for #3276\n\nReview of PR #3277: `publish` also has `!inputs.site_only`, pinned by\nsite_only_dispatch_runs_only_site_and_pages. The decision file is\ndocs/decisions/3276-site-redeploy.md, and it says that the same\nrelease.yml goes on site/v0.25.0 before the dispatch (a dispatch runs the\nworkflow file of the dispatched ref).\n\nRefs #3276\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
